---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/learning.css';
const apiBase=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL??'http://localhost:3000';
---
<Layout title="Agent 开发学习 · CET Reading" bodyClass="learning-page" description="每天两篇官方技术材料，按顺序学习 Agent 的设计、实现、评估与部署。">
  <section id="learning-conflicts" class="container learning-conflicts" role="status" hidden></section>
  <section class="learning-library container" id="news-library" data-api-base={apiBase} aria-labelledby="library-title">
    <header class="learning-intro"><div><h1 id="library-title">Agent 开发学习</h1><p>每天两篇，把原理读懂，把方法用起来。</p></div><span>每日 08:00 更新 · 北京时间</span></header>
    <div class="learning-navigation"><nav aria-label="学习栏目"><button data-tab="learn" aria-current="page">学习</button><button data-tab="route">课程路线</button><button data-tab="history">学习记录</button></nav><label class="learning-search"><span class="sr-only">搜索文章或知识点</span><input id="learning-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索文章或知识点" /></label></div>
    <p id="learning-status" role="status"></p>
    <div id="learning-view" aria-busy="true"><p class="learning-empty">正在准备学习材料…</p></div>

    <noscript>请启用 JavaScript，以加载学习材料。</noscript>
  </section>
  <section class="reader-section container news-reader learning-reader" id="news-reader" hidden aria-labelledby="news-title">
    <div class="reader-topline"><button type="button" class="text-link" id="news-back">← Agent 学习</button><span id="learning-lesson"></span><div class="reader-actions" data-reader-actions><button type="button" class="text-link" id="learning-toc-toggle" aria-expanded="false">目录</button><button type="button" class="text-link" id="learning-ask">问 AI</button></div></div>
    <nav id="learning-toc" aria-label="文章目录" hidden></nav>
    <div class="reader-panel"><header class="reader-heading"><p class="learning-source" id="learning-source"></p><h1 id="news-title" lang="en" tabindex="-1"></h1><div class="reader-details" data-reading-details><p class="news-meta" id="news-meta"></p></div></header>
    <aside class="learning-objective"><span>这一篇要学会</span><p id="learning-objective"></p><small id="learning-prerequisites"></small></aside>
    <div id="news-content"></div>
    <section class="learning-exercise"><h2>读完后，动手试一下</h2><p id="learning-exercise"></p><label><input id="learning-exercise-done" type="checkbox" /> 我已经完成这个练习</label><label class="learning-notes-label" for="learning-notes">学习笔记</label><textarea id="learning-notes" rows="4" maxlength="12000" placeholder="记下一个设计取舍、一段运行结果，或还没理解的问题。"></textarea></section>
    <details class="learning-license"><summary>原文版本与许可</summary><p id="news-attribution"></p><p>文档保留采集时的内容与代码。运行前请对照对应 SDK 当前文档；中文导读和练习为本站学习辅助。</p><pre id="learning-license-text"></pre></details>
    <footer class="learning-reader-footer"><span id="learning-save-status" role="status">阅读位置自动保存</span><div><button id="learning-review" type="button">稍后复习</button><button class="learning-primary" id="learning-complete" type="button">标记已读，继续下一篇 →</button></div></footer>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<script>import '../scripts/news-library';</script>
